{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1415,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a850173423b64e91e9a39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个选择都会创造结果……\r\n要谨慎考虑喔？因为要等到未来\r\n才会知道今天的决定是对是错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09939777588b88cadae7626aa2c8ecdc641bb0b72939dc3793addbf84d0c5d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e192edf799a20b7552c5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你只需……将你所制定出\r\n最完善的训练项目拿来给我就好。\r\n想必一定能让我满意吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db192c8b8d5ab409d00f38d0ca7f9b738c715e91f01a123a496b95d869bd2bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d9beff069cabc0db44949be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是夏季集训的训练资料？\r\n让我看看，拿来参考一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45253f14644476a68d43112baae1f377d6456cc2ac01789a4305468533fc2e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33bdbd70a14b4d8b372aeba7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这片景色不错吧？\r\n……训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7339349a3146647fd0c863489148a2ee00ad379949d4b41d0861642a015daa71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d70cd00fd60dcdaaf7e106b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17599d6469c040d6c935951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好……再来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae622292112ca935e46aa81fdae76d8d7e8ccb20bc3f6b92d0864e6a51494e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01f5f11992e8b15c22437e9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的前方没有任何阻碍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "413deb63e8d492d7f73f85e21ac47e4d57f59d5c5355d36b58921e9769059898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beeb2f62bd1d1e41b06f525c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是天狼星象征，\r\n就陪你玩玩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6337ceb4b3070182fdd1c6e69893851c3c923c0fa98c2c126b816b947f10bf96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7add4d13014a7d995c16700e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大言不惭？我偏要说！\r\n站在世界顶端的……会是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ae49ce2307e1a13a7cc012ac2b2a3875db97bc45403d95790c81fefd005ed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18502a7b91125a43ce8ead4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想追求困难的挑战吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7fda1599e573fc31fa02143a2148c7b6e96aff5649cbc294870bbc756bbcdcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784c216eb0cd824211ae871b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我上场就不会放水喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cb09db568dc77ccdf7461af48fe8d4c28b8a9a80b15ec9710e011beec7fca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3f61a1640a6a9421e2f98e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd96f357ba5430a69a6f82f455fe84c05f9ffa2b4540d9129fa869f2fa6fbda2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7390a018ebeab047a51ff6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全部都是为了『现在』――这一瞬间\n的光辉。将我与您重叠的觉悟，\n印刻在这条轨道上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dd00cc05574ae7f271a5bdd2b7ea4be6fd74d6465659bdfa7b12e71518226b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0432e3058ab97dfd6691c88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd5cb2db29f0246a23e4516",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed02be87d70facb2f0a790bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习结束后，要不要绕个远路？\n昨天和朋友在咖啡厅度过了…\n那一刻如果你也一起度过就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e63c2532b9d64fa6830f23374d9c54fe393de60b3b13889fbb3197aebad10e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21133529135c13acebc033b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的肩膀非常温暖…\n如果能倚靠在这棵树上面的话，\n我好像无论到哪都能振翅高飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d16d2062607f5c6ca3ac493aec966232fd810c1f866e1c8021060bed921edd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32fcdeecff456798533d898d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，手指沾了墨水…\n呵呵，其实是和无敌他们第一次\n写信导致的…洗掉的话，有点可惜呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "725d567bc3f94d35b266ffa1d3ab86c2187e2a9621999e465fba04bb53868584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fe104fae31c5c39fa4aa47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，那个…可以\n陪我一下吗？　\n…这是，给朋友巧克力的练习…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac49c19d22831c566b5c65a712921dbc3b368b1863cb2573a8a9ea0ea7ae7b84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66602f6f48b6e13fa49a0fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给您准备了奶奶\n亲手做的点心。想让你\n尝到温暖的味道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "197b70953756be6c450a3f923317bb25e2fea0fe4944fb12211877cff1182a1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03c248913f56cbf5adcbad4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一年之中，只有一天。\n牛郎星和织女星刹那的相逢。\n强烈的思念在那一瞬间也会闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0690004b60f227485981a56dba0934b8b651fcc0f588aabf90815f6d272e976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a72088e1dc3aee69190120a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们能不能给真正的妖怪\n点心呢？他们的感情，意志…\n我很想了解",
      "source_fingerprint": "64b832f313341d2ec362b8960b1c12b4b80aadbf88a32a088cf1412ea91c04b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c987038df912b0a2f853fc4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今晚宿舍的圣诞老人\n要到房间来。接待的红茶，\n要怎样准备呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b02b507dc1de477dd6caf07e9107dbf12d90b8735fd0d745e12ac206398f13a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:643e3924fb562866275e9988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去看树吗？　\n玻璃外的星星在天上闪闪发光，\n一定很漂亮吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4799f2d68a1017e386c884e0dd24e5baf7f50492b213b1353572820f78f2da8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cfdb0eea7cea38d8a960560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结果很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cbc8d35518193ca31aa190224d96817119009f73056ebd8797a1b8992adf9d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2077036e326fa2803903be85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家每年精心制作的贺年卡，\n我都很期待。我也要怀着\n一年的感谢…对每个人都认真地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f90366c854d6353ae20898fd46ddb52421afd3b6a2b6703df5bd8d59f59c0d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c685d3e69d9f7a6ed3d83fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\n睡眠是健康之本…\n推荐的枕头我之后再给您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "296eac092ad5822e9934a115917a790103a9df4c7a2640aa4e52406cd85dc07b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3816999a50a01cbc4eae4a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们去目白家吧。\n我干劲十足地为您\n准备了生日派对哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1f8363098b3a4b0280ea3df9597c24f80367f675fe5670a2a76a60e3a0bce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571bc2d3923b88472af63685",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上开始千代王就\n一直心神不定的…呵呵♪\n这也是生日的喜悦之一吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3013911ed0bfea00e5041bb458eca1b17273cb16e8434f503988b891ce851df9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c355e12424a9a1ceb289d480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天不绕远路吗？　\n难得的生日，如果能拜托您\n做护花使者的话♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0172b72b2eb34653a7dbd1dd3a5a933e413acca8f1f4c4a9eee4c027dc499112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd049e4b28bc8841948ed1e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦，好像有个通知。\n可能是紧要的消息，\n要不要看一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76201b1de5d2aea581b845abc76c6766f2c034dfff90e01a48421c4aa0216c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70c2987033f15cefab32429",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了呢。呵呵…\n思考里面是什么东西\n的时候也很棒呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "add6d1d426fddbd31d20c808bf476ce3f40a6e9509a655ba68f06c0b8e9858fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1fd3d731a3391c2214d2c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜您完成任务。\n这个小小的积累也会成为\n取得巨大成果的基础吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e0e55ad5130e2e5047fa87c98a7e79443877ba41c93836b00f33ea4fa788d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56764a9409a8e1bd88cc70f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像马上就要\n开始了。我能帮您做\n准备的话就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f7c7261847aa7da24635f120282e694e7687d9ef2f5f49be44105ff4f93a022",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae9233c7a496ccc9c4f1afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动，不去看一眼吗？\n期间限定…也就说只能\n现在享受，不能错过♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "974327dc61b14fb2ab89001e85cbec9ef74d8e4fd686eb5b2c549ddc25a8ee2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158859443ad4710028e230b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常抱歉…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b02cb9f4863ecc4c714c082beae5f41a16aa7a9c91cfd24cb1046082082035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03baf8d3ac76a25160f7f98c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘名鉴的等级\n好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0098e8171238307fde92a6e2a1f68418027cee5b5af4bcedf90937c285da445c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ecef34e90e2a443a28567e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢轻盈触感舒适的衣服\n走路时感受着衣服轻轻飘动……\n心情也会变得轻松起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b010a4e1a51e74b6bfa6edf130f836eec66aba61636684569e610fc16deb4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d00c4aa003dd6379b91ce14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照的裁缝师傅总是会\n给我带合心意的上等布料……\n嗯，这件衣服也是多亏了他。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a48125c753988885d515d6b2ce3998af5403dbe67cd04ee783c3538246c62165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108205501435062599cb9721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天善信邀请我吃了可丽饼……\n呵呵，结果我们俩都把奶油抹到了\n鼻子上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04076b1ebdd73ff503f89fffe133608c0e7199cccba144dd479940ee8510c7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379dab70c9f6b531e48faa01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还过得去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0029a0b784d725dd04c5eaf1001da52e2a215d8678f32d268832ac14c86cf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0dac547297d3b403640197a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58f37ebed132406638abcab186df2b37eae2c6e35c899538c35b9fb5d1bcaca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa03d6354e9bae0cdb49894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常抱歉…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b02cb9f4863ecc4c714c082beae5f41a16aa7a9c91cfd24cb1046082082035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:addf7bc4be64fb82b0c0015b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还过得去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0029a0b784d725dd04c5eaf1001da52e2a215d8678f32d268832ac14c86cf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
